sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant O as Orders
  participant I as Inventory
  participant LA as Log Analytics / CloudWatch

  User->>O: POST confirm order
  O->>I: HTTP reserve stock
  alt Inventory timeout
    I--xO: sin respuesta
    O->>O: ExceptionHandlingMiddleware
    O-->>User: 500 + traceId
    O->>LA: Log OrderId + error
  else OK
    I-->>O: 200
    O-->>User: 200
  end
  Note over User,LA: Investigacion: buscar traceId en logs O e I
